ntern; the glowing float pops out — light 7! Counter: 7 of 12. Captain Ingrid opens the iron lantern for good.","seconds":35,"lines":[{"i":8,"who":"myrobot","guestName":null,"text":"Made it! Found a light!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S14/8.ogg","dur":1.476,"env":"002aspobfj500000000000eusnijioidppshf80000000","words":[["Made",0.1,0.26],["it!",0.26,0.36],["Found",0.74,0.97],["a",0.97,1.05],["light!",1.05,1.28]],"voice":"myrobot"},{"i":9,"who":"guest","guestName":"Captain Ingrid, the harbour master","text":"Seven! Next: the fish market. Mind the floor — it’s icy from the cold store!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S14/9.ogg","dur":5.663,"env":"000ekivvse69ssyvrf00000000002jzzzztk80dmo05c300000uy854tvnvwfzzyuq90fqta0gf9300000000000zzzurwzwb6wc649nwuurpki7000000or8an40qutngklivo46ryzujajcxxuk4dfjcctssrqmmka000000","words":[["Seven!",0.11,0.59],["Next:",0.96,1.34],["the",1.34,1.65],["fish",1.65,2.03],["market.",2.03,2.55],["Mind",2.94,3.22],["the",3.22,3.45],["floor",3.45,3.79],["—",3.79,3.86],["it’s",3.86,4.1],["icy",4.1,4.33],["from",4.33,4.61],["the",4.61,4.84],["cold",4.84,5.12],["store!",5.12,5.46]],"voice":"ingrid"}]},{"setting":"The fish market door slides open: a shiny wet floor, and past it, the sandy beach.","action":"Bolt runs in and slides across the floor on his tummy — wheee — and lands in a heap.","seconds":20,"lines":[{"i":10,"who":"bolt","guestName":null,"text":"Beep-woooooof!","direction":"Sliding.","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S14/10.ogg","dur":2.509,"env":"0rtvr8ovvh000000000000020jwxuzzzzzzxoi77767764345656566875430000020000000000","words":[["Beep",0.06,0.33],["woooooof!",0.48,2.25]],"voice":"bolt"},{"i":11,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"Slippery! Will our robot slide too?","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S14/11.ogg","dur":2.677,"env":"02psrdrzp756ppljb400000009wzwzzvttrrl7gvnqg5kpi42morp8krpnomf4000mcnvuusob0000000","words":[["Slippery!",0.07,0.59],["Will",0.88,1.19],["our",1.19,1.45],["robot",1.45,1.83],[